				<wikidot:authorName>Zander Lassiter</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>6355729</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>Investigation into Audrey Totenmich's social media from when she was alive</p> </blockquote> <p>from when she was alive seems unnecessary to me. I think the reader understands that she's not still posting now that she's dead.<br /> I like that the Granddaughter doesn't hold a grudge against her grandma. It would have been so obvious if she did this to grandma for revenge.</p> 
				 	]]>
